    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "An event chain. Using the block fires msm_examples:beacon_stone_activate, which plays a sound and then triggers msm_examples:beacon_stone_flare with trigger_event. That event spawns particles and runs the function msm_examples:beacon_stone/flare as the player. Chains may nest up to 16 events deep, and an event that triggers itself is reported as a cycle. It reuses the vanilla lodestone model.",
